  "reasoning": "The defendant Zhu colluded with Liu to artificially inflate the assessed area and structure type of a company's property, leading to a fraudulent claim for demolition compensation exceeding 1 million RMB. Zhu then transferred 550,000 RMB to Liu as a share of the illicit gains. This conduct fits the legal definition of fraud (诈骗罪) with a particularly large amount, and no other listed offenses (such as bribery or corruption) apply.",
